Feature: Taking a tower
  A drone counts for a tower when it flies in the [[circle]] of the tower: within 60 m of the
  tower, and not more than 120 m high. The [[control]] of each tower goes from −100 % (Red) to
  +100 % (Blue). Each second, it moves towards the team with more drones in the circle. One
  drone more moves it 5 % each second, so one drone takes a neutral tower in 20 s. Each drone
  more adds 5 % each second.

  A team holds a tower when the control gets to its end of the bar. It loses the tower when the
  control gets back to 0. Between, the tower is neutral, and it gives no points and no vision.

  Expectation: One drone moves the control 5 % each second
    Given the west tower is neutral
    And the control of the west tower is 0 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 0
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the control of the west tower is 50 %
    And the west tower is neutral

  Expectation: One drone takes a neutral tower in 20 seconds
    Given the west tower is neutral
    And the control of the west tower is 0 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 0
    When the game runs for 20 seconds
    Then the west tower is held by Blue
    And the control of the west tower is 100 %

  Expectation: Two drones take a tower in half the time
    Given the west tower is neutral
    And the control of the west tower is 0 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 2
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 0
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the west tower is held by Blue

  Expectation: The same number of drones from each team stops the control
    A circle with drones of the two teams in it is contested. The control moves only by the
    difference between the two teams.

    Given the control of the west tower is 50 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 1
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the control of the west tower is 50 %
    And the circle of the west tower is contested

  Expectation: The team with more drones moves the control by the difference
    Given the west tower is neutral
    And the control of the west tower is 0 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 2
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 1
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the control of the west tower is 50 %
    And the circle of the west tower is contested

  Expectation: An empty circle keeps its control
    A team does not have to stay at a tower to keep the work that it did. It can come back
    later and finish.

    Given the control of the west tower is 50 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 0
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 0
    When the game runs for 1 minute
    Then the control of the west tower is 50 %
    And the circle of the west tower is quiet

  Expectation: A team keeps a tower while the control is on its side
    Given the west tower is held by Red
    And the control of the west tower is -100 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 0
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the control of the west tower is -50 %
    And the west tower is held by Red

  Expectation: A held tower becomes neutral when its control gets back to 0
    Given the west tower is held by Red
    And the control of the west tower is -50 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the Red drones in the west circle are 0
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the west tower is neutral
    And the control of the west tower is 0 %

  Expectation: A drone on the ground does not count
    A drone must fly in the circle. A drone that lands next to a tower does not take it.

    Given the west tower is neutral
    And the control of the west tower is 0 %
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 0
    And the Blue drones on the ground in the west circle are 1
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the control of the west tower is 0 %
